.#-----------------------------------------------------
.input|xwiki/2.1
.# Verify that an inline macro (or a macro located in a table cell) is rendered as text when it wouldn't be read back
.# as the same macro whatever follows it, i.e. when its content contains the start of an inline syntax that isn't
.# ended in the macro (e.g. a backtick, an opening angle bracket followed by a letter, a bracket) and that could thus
.# hide the closing tag of the macro, or when its content ends with a backslash.
.#-----------------------------------------------------
